.DS_Store

# This repo is PUBLIC. GitHub Pages still publishes main at
# ape-studio.github.io/legal the moment it is pushed. The store site is
# https://apestudios.app once that domain is attached. Anything committed
# here is published immediately, so the secret rules matter more here than
# anywhere else, even though nothing secret belongs in it.
